Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.18,0:00:13.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你的留言
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本想在方便和冬弥君说话的时候再打过去的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.10,0:00:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  又睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:28.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前一晚熬夜了…这也不能当借口呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:32.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么工作请加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个  昨天…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.15,0:02:25.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做了件很严重的事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.25,0:02:42.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是新作啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.47,0:02:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是所谓的摇滚的生活方式吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.32,0:02:48.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是叫朋克来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使把其他的全部拿出来也不足一半的价值
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.42,0:03:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然我是要收中介费的  因为是工作
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.08,0:03:06.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然无法保证能不能处理掉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.12,0:03:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于以后的交易请直接联系我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.35,0:03:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的神崎某人不忍心让难得的宝贝发霉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.89,0:03:21.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  这真是失敬了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.76,0:03:31.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好  请多指…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.95,0:03:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.82,0:04:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么…事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.90,0:04:08.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想确认一下接下来的安排
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:16.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚也直播的TOP10  排行榜之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.25,0:04:19.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么本周的第二位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:22.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,森川由绮  「WHITE  ALBUM」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  请问车站在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.37,0:05:20.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去哪儿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.31,0:05:22.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医院  有劳了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.69,0:05:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是问去哪儿转转
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又跑出去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.42,0:06:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛瑙小姐  玛瑙小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.80,0:06:10.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在吧  请快点出来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.81,0:06:12.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你听得见吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之请先把门打开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.41,0:06:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛瑙小姐  玛瑙小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.79,0:06:19.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会和社长好好说的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.27,0:06:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  发生了什么好事么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.89,0:06:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么看出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.38,0:06:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精神过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.95,0:06:40.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白天由绮小姐来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泽仓小姐最近都没见到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.23,0:06:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人忍着吧  一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:02.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是  考虑一下自己的立场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,色…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:04.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样就好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:07.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:15.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥  我有话对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:17.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天再听
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.11,0:07:19.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又在出考题了么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.11,0:07:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是日程安排表
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于2月28日的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:30.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的祭日吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.71,0:07:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对对  因为大家也都有自己的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日程必需得遵守才行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:37.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也适可而止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.03,0:07:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥  由绮小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.62,0:07:46.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说了什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.29,0:07:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.33,0:08:14.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:20.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像做了一场梦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.64,0:08:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为您睡得很熟  我就自己…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.18,0:08:26.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.79,0:08:29.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗  成人仪式吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:31.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了这个季节了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:34.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是这是杂志的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要在某个庭院里拍照
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.70,0:08:39.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做偶像也真辛苦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.86,0:08:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥君也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是个孩子  不配接受成人的祝福
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:47.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:10.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,热情真是高涨呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.33,0:09:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,买进这么多一文不值的风险
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…谁  你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:19.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是记者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.02,0:09:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想继续这样当罪犯吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:31.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说回来你是笨蛋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:36.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光拍经纪人和男人  为什么不拍森川由绮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.58,0:09:39.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮小姐没有错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.28,0:09:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:43.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不愿意伤害由绮小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.99,0:09:45.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也想被人捅吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.09,0:09:47.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好烫好烫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.03,0:09:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你捅过女人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.52,0:09:55.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  做过了  因为太瞧不起人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.10,0:09:57.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没被抓住吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.55,0:09:59.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不够定罪  谁会犯那种傻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:04.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是那家伙第二天就没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:06.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么身体
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.62,0:10:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起那个  听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.82,0:10:13.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所谓报道摄影师呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.68,0:10:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.81,0:11:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不在的话那孩子根本没用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.31,0:11:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道什么时候完成的话  发售的预定也…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.27,0:11:07.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说  玛瑙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:13.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK  今晚要完成两首哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.41,0:11:14.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:21.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了玛瑙  因为要赶着进TOP10
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:30.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去了吗  成人仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.81,0:11:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  理奈也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:37.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.35,0:11:40.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不好都已经忘记了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:44.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是觉得穿盛装的女孩子真多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.99,0:11:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.35,0:11:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近和由绮见面了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.98,0:11:56.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  因为现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:57.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.44,0:12:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是知道了由绮的日程安排的话  给你点时间也…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.73,0:12:07.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作的时候由绮的话题就…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.35,0:12:10.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是呢  抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.55,0:12:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个人都很忙  完全都忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:25.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个人一起大笑了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.71,0:12:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮去了成人仪式吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.76,0:12:33.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次请让我看看你盛装的照片吧  再见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.81,0:12:36.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,礼物？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.26,0:12:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你的生日吧  下个星期天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.11,0:12:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为不知道能不能见面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.27,0:12:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,双方都可能有事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.13,0:12:48.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要做这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.08,0:12:52.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么…  你看  圣诞前夜也收了你的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.11,0:12:56.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是给由绮…  而且不是还付过钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:58.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.75,0:13:03.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了那是想给朋友的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听成什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.22,0:13:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了  省得浪费了  我就收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.91,0:13:11.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:14.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面就不看了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:19.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  过会看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.46,0:13:22.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你傻站着干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.73,0:13:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多该告诉我了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:29.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:30.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想考的学校
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.62,0:13:33.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,申请书已经提交完了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.57,0:13:36.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也已经没什么时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:41.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也差不多该考虑下倾向和对策什么的了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道听不见  不告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.15,0:13:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么在广告之后终于到了本周TOP3的发表
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.39,0:13:55.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上周的第一位是绪方理奈  「SOUND  OF  DESTINY」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.44,0:13:59.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  是新起点的女王本周也保持第一
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.57,0:14:02.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是人气急速上升的原妹妹森川由绮…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.10,0:14:05.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想听？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.35,0:14:10.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  麻奈那样比较能集中的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.70,0:14:12.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很在意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.53,0:14:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.83,0:14:16.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近和由绮见面了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.87,0:14:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有  最近一直都很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  我又被理奈…小姐雇用了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是顽固呢  樵夫的妄想
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.17,0:14:31.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lesson  4  chapter  1
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.72,0:14:33.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Are  you  all  right, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.59,0:14:36.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Better  ask  my  nurse
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:39.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My  English  is  not  good  enough  for  me  to  know
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.12,0:14:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The  daughter  of  mine  seems  to  be  not  in  them
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.01,0:14:47.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,She called  a  lot  before  hard  time, doesn't  she?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:14:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻奈  老师来了？…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.28,0:15:09.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是…藤井…老师呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.87,0:15:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗  是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.67,0:15:16.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好像已经知道了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.82,0:15:20.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为很少见一直继续干的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.91,0:15:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还以为是什么样认真的老师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.27,0:15:28.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大白天两个人在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.38,0:15:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个我有好好地…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和麻奈说了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:35.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缠着绪方理奈来我事务所的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:39.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(940.572,672)}还有  和森川由绮…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(341.714,670.857)}社长
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.79,0:15:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.88,0:15:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻奈  你看…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(922.286,672)}好像是真的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.79,0:15:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(406.857,672)}骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:45.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以一开始…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻奈…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.05,0:15:52.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴  闭嘴  …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.42,0:15:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这些大人想做什么就去做什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.29,0:16:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样怎么可能去考试！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.41,0:16:10.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻奈别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.85,0:16:12.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.08,0:16:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻奈…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.16,0:16:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们全都去死  去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.73,0:16:21.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻奈  妈妈要生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啰嗦  滚出去  滚出去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:26.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:28.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让开  老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.07,0:16:40.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说我是老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.65,0:16:44.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老太婆…那孩子什么时候学会那种话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.55,0:16:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藤井君
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.95,0:16:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.18,0:16:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.83,0:16:50.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想办法…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.07,0:16:54.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是教师的责任吧  我马上要出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.97,0:17:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想遥老师会有办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:15.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,适可而止吧  总是让我给你擦屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.29,0:17:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当父母是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.27,0:17:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不想一直让父亲照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.13,0:17:25.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你染手的女孩子  被人抢走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.93,0:17:27.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.92,0:17:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家现在都怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.83,0:17:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:34.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心理创伤吗  因为放走的猎物太大了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:39.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还准备像小孩子一样天真到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.49,0:17:41.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该说过让你放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.44,0:17:44.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现如今政治结婚什么的可不流行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.42,0:17:46.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,财阀是没落的别名啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.63,0:17:49.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且对方还是个任性的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:52.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行不行  让个艺人嫁进家里来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.96,0:17:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一族人的羞耻
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.13,0:18:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了早已经把她忘掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.87,0:18:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.28,0:18:15.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.13,0:18:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次的曲子是弹唱的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.60,0:18:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.57,0:18:49.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个要由由绮来弹
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.48,0:18:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.53,0:19:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮小姐  是神崎社长打来的电话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.41,0:19:26.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是神崎  给我家里打个电话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.20,0:19:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是神崎  联络我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是理奈  刚才神崎社长打电话给我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.14,0:19:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听语气好像很确定我和藤井君在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.44,0:19:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是由绮  刚才接到了M3的神崎社长的电话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.19,0:19:57.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说和冬弥君联系不上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.16,0:20:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也在上课说了句对不起就挂了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.53,0:20:05.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是把医院的电话号码告诉她比较…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:08.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是神崎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.37,0:20:24.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  我是藤井
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.44,0:20:26.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一晚上跑哪儿闲逛去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.46,0:20:28.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.06,0:20:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻奈还没回来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.45,0:20:34.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和叫遥的女孩子在一起吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.47,0:20:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道在哪儿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.13,0:20:40.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想报警啊  你明白吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.37,0:20:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来  在echoes见到的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.65,0:20:48.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说正月两个人要去合宿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.28,0:20:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是  高中的时候遥经常和哥哥一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.12,0:21:09.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,田丸…君
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.86,0:21:26.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是平良木
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.19,0:21:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.77,0:21:32.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电话不行  要见面才说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.36,0:21:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.28,0:21:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请等一会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.04,0:24:22.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二十二页
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.43,0:24:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在因为嘴笨而烦恼？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.29,0:24:27.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试着用眼神去交流吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.39,0:24:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻就会变得想说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.91,0:24:31.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,White  Album
